<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_WarmingEffect</defName>
    <label>暖脉丹药效</label>
    <description>以桃木正气温养经脉的前期丹药。活体萌螈服用后最低舒适温度降低15℃，持续2天；不治疗失温或冻伤。重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ComfyTemperatureMin>-15</ComfyTemperatureMin>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CoolingEffect</defName>
    <label>清暑丹药效</label>
    <description>以阴沉木调和暑热的前期丹药。活体萌螈服用后最高舒适温度提高15℃，持续2天；不治疗中暑、不增加煞气。重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ComfyTemperatureMax>15</ComfyTemperatureMax>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_IndustryEffect</defName>
    <label>百工丹药效</label>
    <description>温和提振专注的日常丹药。活体萌螈服用后全局工作速度提高20%，研究速度额外提高10%，同条件研究综合提高32%，持续1天。无需开脉，不成瘾，重复使用只刷新时长。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>1.2</WorkSpeedGlobal>
          <ResearchSpeed>1.1</ResearchSpeed>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_RecoveryEffect</defName>
    <label>回元丹冷却</label>
    <description>即时回复最大螈气的40%，每枚最多200点，不超过缺失量。冷却6小时。需一级以上仍有功能的灵螈脉络；不修复经脉或移除枯竭状态。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CombatEffect</defName>
    <label>临战丹药效</label>
    <description>持续8小时：近战伤害×1.20，移动×1.15，瞄准时间×0.85，受到伤害×0.90。随后6小时工作速度×0.90。药效与疲劳期间禁止再服；需一级以上仍有功能的灵螈脉络。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_CombatMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.2</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MoveSpeed>1.15</MoveSpeed>
          <AimingDelayFactor>0.85</AimingDelayFactor>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.9</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>1</minSeverity>
        <label>药后疲劳</label>
        <statFactors>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>0.9</WorkSpeedGlobal>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_CapacityEffect</defName>
    <label>纳煞丹药效</label>
    <description>煞气稳定容量×1.50，持续10天。当前煞气不变。到期前24小时及1小时提示；到期容量下降可能导致超限。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_CapacityMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_PurifyEffect</defName>
    <label>涤煞丹药效</label>
    <description>持续10天，将当前煞气硬封顶至实时稳定容量的80%。低于上限不补煞。容量低于375时暂时抑制夜叉珍珠300下限，保留珍珠增长系数和剩余时长；不直接解除狂暴。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_PurifyMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_GatherEffect</defName>
    <label>聚煞丹冷却</label>
    <description>即时增加最多300煞气，只补至容量90%，有涤煞药效时只补至80%。冷却6小时，不增加阴气、进化进度或容量。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>MX_DispelEffect</defName>
    <label>镇煞丹药效</label>
    <description>药效12小时。实际消耗螈气的攻击直接命中螈僵时散去20基础煞气；同次攻击同目标一次，每次最多60，同一对角色间隔180 ticks。沿用飞僵和散煞倍率，不突破珍珠有效下限；护盾、位移、未命中和持续伤害不触发。</description>
    <hediffClass>MoeLotlExpansion.Hediff_TimedMedicine</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
  </HediffDef>
</Defs>
